# sriq ABox split (slice 9j): individuals sharing a type set. a1, a2 and a3 are all X; b is Y.
# Y is unsatisfiable through Y ⊑ ∃s.P and Y ⊑ ∀s.¬P. One representative per type set is checked,
# and b's makes the input inconsistent.
# Expect: inconsistent.

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:X a owl:Class . :Y a owl:Class . :P a owl:Class . :s a owl:ObjectProperty .
:Y rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :s ; owl:someValuesFrom :P ] .
:Y rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :s ; owl:allValuesFrom [ owl:complementOf :P ] ] .
:a1 a owl:NamedIndividual , :X . :a2 a owl:NamedIndividual , :X . :a3 a owl:NamedIndividual , :X .
:b a owl:NamedIndividual , :Y .
